{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651410/extras/a58de61d7e01452f05eb9674947f1759.poster.avif?t=1757861398\" width=736 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651410/extras/a58de61d7e01452f05eb9674947f1759.webm?t=1757861398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651410/extras/a58de61d7e01452f05eb9674947f1759.mp4?t=1757861398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this city, there are two paths: <strong>preserve order</strong> or <strong>fuel the chaos.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with your friends, pull off sabotages, escalate events, or keep the city under control by enforcing order. Every choice shifts the course of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651410/extras/6c3911642a56c0d3e0d4c74f64652fd2.poster.avif?t=1757861398\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651410/extras/6c3911642a56c0d3e0d4c74f64652fd2.webm?t=1757861398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651410/extras/6c3911642a56c0d3e0d4c74f64652fd2.mp4?t=1757861398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The massive shield covering the city weakens as players stir up more chaos\u2014until it finally shatters. That moment decides who will come out on top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the fun isn\u2019t only in the grand finale. In a city powered by absurd physics, even the smallest actions can spiral into something huge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based sandbox gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Social interaction with positional voice chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sabotages and unpredictable events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dynamic, living city</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online experience with friends</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even a single stone can shatter a window and spark a chain of chaos. Thanks to the physics, every move can end in something hilarious\u2014or disastrous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651410/extras/b8f21b53777496f92bcdb9d1f6945389.poster.avif?t=1757861398\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651410/extras/b8f21b53777496f92bcdb9d1f6945389.webm?t=1757861398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651410/extras/b8f21b53777496f92bcdb9d1f6945389.mp4?t=1757861398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, everything is shaped by the players\u2019 choices.  <br>Which side will you take?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3651410?t=1757861398","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3651410?t=1757861398","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651410/8035a8c522a10af6df990e24552abf4a9e5fa088/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757861398","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651410/8035a8c522a10af6df990e24552abf4a9e5fa088/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757861398","categories":[{"descript