 it finally shatters. That moment decides who will come out on top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the fun isn\u2019t only in the grand finale. In a city powered by absurd physics, even the smallest actions can spiral into something huge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based sandbox gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Social interaction with positional voice chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sabotages and unpredictable events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dynamic, living city</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online experience with friends</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even a single stone can shatter a window and spark a chain of chaos. Thanks to the physics, every move can end in something hilarious\u2014or disastrous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651410/extras/b8f21b53777496f92bcdb9d1f6945389.poster.avif?t=1757861398\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651410/extras/b8f21b53777496f92bcdb9d1f6945389.webm?t=1757861398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651410/extras/b8f21b53777496f92bcdb9d1f6945389.mp4?t=1757861398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, everything is shaped by the players\u2019 choices.  <br>Which side will you take?</p>","developers":["Mehmet \u00d6zkan"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651410/5ccba19ae02e259e53c8fba1419ef59982fc0110/header.jpg